{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"void_stalker","model_identifier":"void_stalker","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# void_stalker\n\nVoid stalker (C3), walker, 2.0 m = 71 u.\n\nA thin purple hunter: dark violet hide with a faint shimmer, long blade-like forearms (black blades with silver edges and violet glowing seams running past the hands), a smooth black eyeless head swept back into a long crest with a single glowing violet slit, black shoulder spurs, and a ragged dark cloak with a hood (`hood` bone on the head) pulled over it while it stalks; outside stalk/reveal the hood is scaled to 0 (it shows in the bind pose). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus `cloak` > `hood`.\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.8..8.8, y 0.0..72.0, z -6.0..14.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 72 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0 (stalk: 18 x 52 x 24)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop |  |\n| `stalk` | 1.6 | loop | crouched, hooded creep (loop) |\n| `attack_slash` | 0.9 | once | key 0.42 s: both blades scissor down and apart in front |\n| `reveal` | 1.4 | once | from the hooded crouch it straightens and the hood slides back and dissolves into the void (0.4-0.7 s, scale keys) and spreads its blades |\n| `aggro` | 1.2 | once | blades spread, head cocked |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.40 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 49.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 160.0 u/s (4.50 m/s), cycle 0.62 s, 99.2 u per cycle\n- `stalk`: 24.9 u/s (0.70 m/s), cycle 1.6 s, 39.8 u per cycle (crouched creep, hooded)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_slash`: key 0.42 s: both blades scissor down and apart in front\n- `reveal`: from the hooded crouch it straightens and the hood slides back and dissolves into the void (0.4-0.7 s, scale keys) and spreads its blades\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 71, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 50, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 54.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 60.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 48, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7.5, 32, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.25, 40, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7.5, 32, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5, 38, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5, 38, 2)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_slit and glow_blade_* are the lit cubes.\n"},"description":"# void_stalker\n\nVoid stalker (C3), walker, 2.0 m = 71 u.\n\nA thin purple hunter: dark violet hide with a faint shimmer, long blade-like forearms (black blades with silver edges and violet glowing seams running past the hands), a smooth black eyeless head swept back into a long crest with a single glowing violet slit, black shoulder spurs, and a ragged dark cloak with a hood (`hood` bone on the head) pulled over it while it stalks; outside stalk/reveal the hood is scaled to 0 (it shows in the bind pose). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus `cloak` > `hood`.\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.8..8.8, y 0.0..72.0, z -6.0..14.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 72 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0 (stalk: 18 x 52 x 24)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop |  |\n| `stalk` | 1.6 | loop | crouched, hooded creep (loop) |\n| `attack_slash` | 0.9 | once | key 0.42 s: both blades scissor down and apart in front |\n| `reveal` | 1.4 | once | from the hooded crouch it straightens and the hood slides back and dissolves into the void (0.4-0.7 s, scale keys) and spreads its blades |\n| `aggro` | 1.2 | once | blades spread, head cocked |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.40 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 49.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 160.0 u/s (4.50 m/s), cycle 0.62 s, 99.2 u per cycle\n- `stalk`: 24.9 u/s (0.70 m/s), cycle 1.6 s, 39.8 u per cycle (crouched creep, hooded)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_slash`: key 0.42 s: both blades scissor down and apart in front\n- `reveal`: from the hooded crouch it straightens and the hood slides back and dissolves into the void (0.4-0.7 s, scale keys) and spreads its blades\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 71, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 50, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 54.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 60.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 48, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7.5, 32, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.25, 40, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7.5, 32, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5, 38, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5, 38, 2)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_slit and glow_blade_* are the lit cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,35.0,-2.5],"to":[4.0,40.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,35.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[60,55,68.0,60.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[106,55,111.0,60.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[68,55,76.0,60.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[111,55,116.0,60.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[76,55,84.0,60.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[84,55,92.0,60